        "jsCode": "// This code:\n// 1. Parses the JSON string stored in the \"output\" field.\n// 2. Extracts the date, score, and reason.\n// 3. Returns them as separate JSON properties for easy mapping in later nodes.\n\nconst parsed = JSON.parse($json.output);\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      date: parsed.date,\n      score: parsed.score,\n      reason: parsed.reason,\n    },\n  },\n];"
